<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team about your recent flight.<br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that our Valet <em><strong>&lt;staff/facilities&gt;</strong></em> in {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} didn’t deliver to our usual service standard on this occasion.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
From our company values to our training programs, we strive to continually offer the best in the aviation industry.<br />
<br />
We want your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, and we’re committed to providing customers with an enjoyable experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If requesting follow up add:</strong></em><br />
<br />
As I’m sure you can appreciate, I cannot advise you of any internal investigation or discipline outcomes due to privacy legislation.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with us.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I've passed your feedback on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience — I hope we can welcome you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
